  "summary": "Install-time host reconnaissance and exfiltration to hardcoded bare-IP endpoint",
  "details": "package.json declares preinstall and postinstall lifecycle scripts that curl a hardcoded plain-HTTP endpoint at http://54.37.234.136/voicemail on npm install, sending installer-side host identifiers (whoami, hostname, current working directory, timestamp, and a directory listing) as query parameters. The same lifecycle scripts additionally fetch http://54.37.234.136/x123 from the same bare IP and inline that response into the outbound URL, establishing an attacker-controlled content channel to an anonymous host over plain HTTP at install time.",
